data: {"type": "response.output_text.done", "sequence_number": 290, "item_id": "msg_gen-1792280824-EjaG2GHqHSeqZzpiSTWj", "output_index": 1, "content_index": 0, "text": "Prince Hamlet of Denmark returns home to find his uncle Claudius has murdered his father, seized the throne, and married his widowed mother Gertrude — a crime revealed to Hamlet by his father's ghost. Feigning madness while seeking proof of the murder, Hamlet's delays and schemes lead to escalating tragedy, culminating in a final duel in which Gertrude, Claudius, Laertes, and Hamlet himself all die."}

